Calculate iUsuario as pUsername
Calculate iPaso as pPassword
Calculate iContent as pImagen

Do iHeadersList.$define(iHeaderName,iHeaderValue)
Do iHeadersList.$add("Content-Type","application/json")

Calculate iURI as "http://www.ocrwebservice.com/restservices/processDocument?language=spanish&pagerange=allpages&tobw=true&gettext=true&newline=1"

Do $cinst.$init(iURI,kOW3httpMethodPost,iHeadersList,iContent,kOW3httpAuthTypeBasic,iUsuario,iPaso) Returns lOk
If not(lOk)
	OK message {Error [$cinst.$errorcode]: [$cinst.$errortext]}
	Quit method kFalse
End If
Do $cinst.$start() Returns lOk